  "bodyHash": "75ebce2fa73cfd13",
  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>礦工眼鏡</strong></span>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/727/679/imagem_2023-09-11_120425105.png\" alt=\"礦工眼鏡\" width=\"585\" height=\"325\"></strong></span></h3>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>關於</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">礦工眼鏡</strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">是一款為遊戲增添新採礦方式的模組，你可以透過全新的</span><strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">鏡片</strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">物品輕鬆製作這副眼鏡。裝備眼鏡後，按下</span><strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">眼鏡能力鍵</strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">（預設為 H），附近範圍內的礦石會發光並容易辨識（類似於</span><em style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">透視</em><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">）。眼鏡具備升級功能，能讓你看到更多種類的礦石，例如：</span><strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">煤炭眼鏡</strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">可看見煤炭礦石，</span><strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">青金石眼鏡</strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">可看見煤炭與青金石礦石，</span><strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">銅眼鏡</strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">則可看見煤炭、青金石與銅礦石，升級還可繼續往上提升。本模組使用</span><strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Forge</strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">與</span><strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">GeckoLib</strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">。</span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>開始使用</strong></strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">你可以在工作台上用 3 顆紫水晶和 6 個玻璃製作鏡片，接著就能合成第一副眼鏡。這副初始眼鏡沒有特殊功能，但搭配 8 個煤炭即可製作煤炭眼鏡。部分升級需要鍛造台與鍛造模板（<strong>眼鏡模板</strong>，由 1 個金錠與 8 個銅錠製作）。若要修理眼鏡，只需使用鐵砧與鏡片即可。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>升級列表</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">升級順序如下：</span></p>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>礦工眼鏡</strong> - 基礎眼鏡，由 2 個鏡片、2 個金錠、4 個銅錠與 1 顆螢石粉製作：</span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/727/693/imagem_2023-09-11_121957179.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"125\" height=\"124\"></span></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>煤炭眼鏡</strong> - 在工作台上將初始眼鏡置於中央，周圍放上煤炭；</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>青金石眼鏡</strong> - 在鍛造台上將煤炭眼鏡放入基礎槽位、青金石放入添加槽位、眼鏡模板放入模板槽位；</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>銅眼鏡</strong> - 在鍛造台上將青金石眼鏡放入基礎槽位、銅錠放入添加槽位、眼鏡模板放入模板槽位；</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鐵眼鏡</strong> - 在工作台上將銅眼鏡置於中央，周圍放上鐵錠；</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>紅石眼鏡</strong> -&nbsp;在鍛造台上將鐵眼鏡放入基礎槽位、紅石放入添加槽位、眼鏡模板放入模板槽位；</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>金眼鏡</strong> - 在工作台上將紅石眼鏡置於中央，周圍放上金錠；</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>綠寶石眼鏡</strong> -&nbsp;在鍛造台上將金眼鏡放入基礎槽位、綠寶石放入添加槽位、眼鏡模板放入模板槽位；</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鑽石眼鏡</strong> - 在工作台上將綠寶石眼鏡置於中央，上方放置鑽石塊，周圍放上鑽石；</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>獄髓眼鏡</strong> -&nbsp;在鍛造台上將鑽石眼鏡放入基礎槽位、獄髓錠放入添加槽位、眼鏡模板放入模板槽位；</span></span></li>\n</ol>",
